  "method": "Execute original filesystem observation -> capacity refresh -> eviction selector.\n\nOriginal filesystem virtual+0x88 dispatches through its recorded vtable, its\nstatvfs adapter multiplies public Darwin fields, and the cache controller joins\nthose observations with the original compiled capacity record. The real prune\nowner, policy/size callbacks and selector then execute until the selector returns,\nbefore logical removal, disk IO or telemetry. Supplied filesystem responses,\nclocks and descriptor/index inputs are explicit; no Dart output is an authority.\n",
